<title>USA: BankAtlantic Bancorp Q4 earnings rise.</title>
<headline>BankAtlantic Bancorp Q4 earnings rise.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.50		    $0.19</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.42		     0.19</p>
<p> Net			  7,661		    2,695</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	15,436		   13,890</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	19,929		   13,890</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.26		    $1.21</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.16		     1.20</p>
<p> Net			 19,011		   16,389</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	15,117		   13,668</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	17,466		   13,668</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1996 results were hurt by a $7.2 million pre-tax charge in the third quarter to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
